        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/498917?u=168bc3756bda2c1e4962b687bed0c85f18902638&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The data was collected from Chrome 137 (stable) and 138 (beta) using new<br>\ntests in the collector:<br>\n<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3130406765\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/issues/2453\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/pull/2453/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector/pull/2453\">openwebdocs/mdn-bcd-collector#2453</a></p>",
