        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF140 removes the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/MutationEvent\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">MutationEvent</code></a> and associated events such as <code class=\"notranslate\">DOMAttrModified</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">DOMCharacterDataModified</code> ... in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1963043\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1963043</a><br>\n(These are behind a pref that is now false).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This marks the API as removed. The events do not appear to have any BCD entries so no changes there.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3124363972\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39825\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39825/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39825\">mdn/content#39825</a></p>",
